{"kind": "mod", "id": 431, "name": "RGBLasers", "slug": "rgblasers", "teaser": "Adds configurable laser color settings to the BepInEx plugin configuration menu.", "owner_name": "kiobu", "downloads": 9570, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/622.png", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:34.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-04-08T15:55:35.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-04-08T15:55:35.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.2.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://pomf2.lain.la/f/ibtioo7k.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://pomf2.lain.la/f/ibtioo7k.png\" alt=\"ibtioo7k.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ftp.hxr.sh/img/rgblasers_v120.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://ftp.hxr.sh/img/rgblasers_v120.gif\" alt=\"rgblasers_v120.gif\" /></a></p>\n<p><em>This BepInEx plugin allows you to modify the RGB values of rendered laserbeams in the game world. There is also a rainbow mode, for a perpetually changing rainbow effect.</em></p>\n<p>This plugin currently modifies all rendered laser beams in-game. That means any AI using laser attachments will have the same laser effects as you do (afaik). This also means you can’t change the color for specific laser modules, ie. you can’t have a red and a green laser simultaneously (for now).</p>\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Customizable laser color, including a cycling rainbow option.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom mesh options to increase laser size, density, distance, etc.</strong></li>\n<li>Lasers are easily configurable via the BepInEx configuration menu (F1/F12).</li>\n<li>Zero FPS impact.</li>\n<li>Compatible with all light/laser bundle edit mods, including <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1529-better-lasers/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">[alex’s Better Lasers]</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1880-brightlasers/?highlight=BrightLasers\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">[BrightLasers]</a>!</li>\n<li>Validated to work on various different versions of SPT-AKI.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p>Simply drop the <strong>RGBLasers.dll</strong> file into your <strong>BepInEx/plugins</strong> folder.</p>\n<p>Open the BepInEx plugin configuration menu in-game (F12 by default) and change the values to your liking. If rainbow mode is enabled, the RGB values will be ignored.</p>\n<p><strong>Known Bugs</strong></p>\n<p>None, so far.</p>\n<p><strong>Changelog</strong></p>\n<p>The release notes <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/kiobu/aki-rgblasers/releases\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">[here]</a> describe changes per version.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.7.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2445, "published_at": "2022-08-15T13:32:23.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/431/rgblasers/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.7.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1909, "published_at": "2023-08-30T03:02:53.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/431/rgblasers/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.1", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1534, "published_at": "2024-0